stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Running : Scheduled to Node
    Running --> Succeeded : Completed without errors
    Running --> Failed : Exit Code 1 / OOMKilled
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    Pending : Waiting for kube-scheduler and image pull
    Running : At least one container is currently executing
    Failed : All containers terminated with at least one failure
    Succeeded : All containers in pod completed successfully
